{"id":"56dcd157465c8761","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties.md","title":"Properties of Logspace Reductions","display":"thm-logspace-reduction-properties — Properties of Logspace Reductions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties","aliases":["28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties"],"display":"thm-logspace-reduction-properties — Properties of Logspace Reductions","depends_on":["[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]","[[28-df-l]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-logspace-reduction-properties — Properties of Logspace Reductions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a91903f455f49892\" href=\"?note=a91903f455f49892\" title=\"28-df-logspace-reduction\">28-df-logspace-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> 见对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\land B\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}C)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}C,\\\\\n(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\land B\\in\\mathbf L)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathbf L.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\land B\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}C)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}C,\\\\\n(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\land B\\in\\mathbf L)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathbf L.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对复合函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(f(x))\">\\(g(f(x))\\)</span> 模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的虚拟输入带，保存其所读的下标，并在需要时重新逐位计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的输出长度为多项式，故虚拟头下标只需对数空间；暂停 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的配置和重算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的工作空间之和仍为对数。长度域谓词用同样模拟处理，故复合仍属于 FL。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的特征函数得到第二式。</p>\n<p>来源核对：引理4.17及证明；印刷88–89页；PDF114–115页。虚拟输入带证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-logspace-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"a91903f455f49892","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-l]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\land B\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}C)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}C,\\\\\n(A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\land B\\in\\mathbf L)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathbf L.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"g(f(x))","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1269,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计算模型与空间归约接口：[[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]、[[28-df-pspace-complete]]、[[28-thm-space-time-relations]]、[[28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties]]。"}],"outgoing":["a91903f455f49892","e145640be927aa76"]}